Error [E0120]: `choice` was not moved here, so its contents cannot be taken apart
  --> tests/ui/borrowed_mutable_view_enum_pattern.jet:7:8
    |
  7 |     if choice == {
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: `choice` grants read-only access to `Choice`, so its non-copyable parts cannot be taken apart with the move-capability marker `^`
 Fix: change the parameter to `choice: ^Choice` with the move-capability marker `^`, or inspect it without binding its contents
